  ('243744', 'undergraduate', ARRAY['Computer Science','Mechanical Engineering','Bioengineering','Electrical Engineering','Aeronautics and Astronautics','Chemical Engineering','Civil Engineering','Materials Science and Engineering','Management Science and Engineering','Mathematics','Physics','Symbolic Systems']::text[], ARRAY['Computer Science','Mechanical Engineering','Bioengineering','Electrical Engineering','Aeronautics and Astronautics','Chemical Engineering','Civil Engineering','Materials Science and Engineering','Management Science and Engineering','Mathematics','Physics']::text[], '2025-26', 65910, 21315, 1818, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1510, 1580, 'required', '{"REA": "2026-11-01", "RD": "2027-01-05"}', 'admission.stanford.edu and financialaid.stanford.edu were unreachable by direct fetch (connection refused/timeout); test policy and deadlines come from the search-tool extract of those official pages (REA Nov 1, RD Jan 5; pages list month/day only, year assumed for fall 2027 entry). Stanford says no English proficiency exam is required and sets no minimum scores, so min_ielts/min_toefl/min_duolingo are null. CDS 2025-26 is hosted only on Google Drive (not readable); avg_gpa4 null. fees_usd = Technology $95 + Campus Health Service Fee $271 + ASSU $240 per quarter x 3 quarters = $1,818 (mail fee $42/qtr only for campus housing; one-time $250 document and $525 orientation fees excluded). health_insurance_usd = Cardinal Care $2,744 x 3 quarters, waivable with comparable coverage. | health_insurance_usd=8232 | Sources: https://admission.stanford.edu/apply/international/index.html ; https://admission.stanford.edu/apply/first-year/decision_process.html ; https://studentservices.stanford.edu/my-finances/tuition-fees/non-tuition-charges-fees/2025-2026-non-tuition-charges-fees ; https://vaden.stanford.edu/student-health-matters-2526/cardinal-care-student-health-insurance/cardinal-care-cost-and-coverage ; https://majors.stanford.edu/majors/text-only-lists-majors-an