the cost page is undated so academic_year is null. health_insurance_usd is the estimated annual cost stated on the international page (college does not sell insurance). Majors are A.S./A.A. programs listed on the official associate-science page; some programs are not available to F-1 students. | health_insurance_usd=1300 | Sources: https://www.broward.edu/international/students/index.html ; https://www.broward.edu/admissions/tuition-costs/index.html ; https://www.broward.edu/academics/associate-science.html', 'https://collegescorecard.ed.gov/school/?132709-Broward-College', '2026-10-05'),
